It is Wednesday morning and I am walking to the U-Bahn.
It is only eight o'clock, but it is already very hot.
The sun is shining brightly onto the street.
My morning was quite stressful today.
Unfortunately, my alarm clock was much too quiet.
I was very tired and simply stayed in bed.
That is why I had no time for breakfast.
I also had no time for a coffee at home.
Now I am standing on the platform and waiting.
The U-Bahn arrives and I quickly get in.
The train is very full and the air is warm.
My stomach is growling loudly.
I am really very hungry.
There is a good bakery next to the office.
I will buy a bread roll there in a moment.
And of course I will also buy a coffee.
Then I will finally be ready for the workday.
